---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Conversations needing attention (the default), or an explicit history view

Usage: mxr messages list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --turn <TURN>
          Explicit view: all conversations, your turn, or waiting on them

          Possible values:
          - all:    All conversations, including archived and sent-only history
          - mine:   Your turn
          - theirs: Waiting on them

      --unread
          Only rows with a message from them you haven't read

      --past-pace
          Only rows where your turn has run past your usual pace with them

      --limit <LIMIT>
          Rows to list in Recent and Quiet; totals count them all

          [default: 50]

      --account <ACCOUNT>
          Limit to one account; the default covers every account

      --format <FORMAT>
          [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
